title: Changelog
new-page: true
is-special: true

= Changelog

**Version 0.8**: cards, advisors, events and endings are taken out while the game is rebuilt; the government line and the President show party colours; hover cards for Zinoviev and Radek.

**Version 0.7**: the menu links sit centred at the top; a panel on the right, empty for now; Replace an advisor sits next to the deck and End the month is gone; Reichstag seats and group results in percent; a new opening text about what the party can do.

**Version 0.6**: advisors: three posts in the Zentrale, ten historical candidates, each post acting once every six months, and a card to replace them; one Party Affairs deck instead of three, with the old cards taken out while they are rewritten; an End the month card; a tighter main page with four cards to a row; larger hover cards that look the same everywhere.

**Version 0.5**: an admin panel for achievements, images and texts; achievements can be unlocked; a centred layout; hover cards for parties and factions; party colours that follow each party's leadership; the KPD's leadership changes only at party congresses.

**Version 0.4**: a new title screen with a changelog and achievements; the game starts straight away with a hand of four cards; the party leader's portrait sits above the decks; exact numbers can be turned on in the options.

**Version 0.3**: the sidebar has four tabs (Main, Party, Politics, Polls) and focuses on the Republic, the other parties and the revolution; advisor slots; hover boxes always fit on the screen.

**Version 0.2**: a standalone game. You play the whole KPD, and your decisions strengthen or anger its five factions. Party colours.

**Version 0.1**: the first prototype, January 1923 to April 1924.

- @backSpecialScene: Back.
